---
// Componente de llamada a la acción
---

<section
    class="py-16 md:py-24 px-4 bg-background grid-pattern relative overflow-hidden border-t-4 border-primary"
>
    <!-- Elementos decorativos -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10">
        <div
            class="absolute top-10 left-10 w-40 h-40 bg-primary/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"
        >
        </div>
        <div
            class="absolute bottom-10 right-10 w-40 h-40 bg-accent/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"
        >
        </div>
        <div
            class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-60 h-60 bg-secondary/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"
        >
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-8">
            <div
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-primary/10 rounded-full border-2 border-primary shadow-lg"
            >
                <svg
                    class="w-5 h-5 text-primary"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                >
                    <path
                        stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                        stroke-width="2"
                        d="M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z"
                    ></path>
                </svg>
                <span
                    class="font-bold text-primary text-sm uppercase tracking-wider"
                    >Comienza Gratis</span
                >
            </div>

            <h2
                class="text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-black leading-tight"
            >
                ¿Listo para tu <span class="text-primary">próximo</span>
                <span class="text-accent">experimento</span>?
            </h2>

            <p
                class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed"
            >
                Únete a miles de estudiantes que ya están explorando el
                fascinante mundo de la ciencia
            </p>

            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center pt-4">
                <a href="#experiments">
                    <button
                        class="bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 text-xl px-6 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition-all hover:scale-105 inline-flex items-center gap-2"
                    >
                        Empezar Ahora
                        <svg
                            class="w-6 h-6"
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        >
                            <path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="4"
                                d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </button>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div
            class="pt-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 items-center text-sm text-muted-foreground font-medium"
        >
            <div class="hidden md:block"></div>
            <div class="text-center">
                <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors"
                    >Términos y Condiciones</a
                >
            </div>
            <div class="text-center md:text-right">
                © Divulgando Ciencia. <a
                    href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">CC BY-NC 4.0</a
                >
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
